From FiveLowpassInitNoError Require Import Spec.
Theorem no_error_proved:Spec.NoError.
Proof. unfold Spec.NoError;intros args m (b&p&tau&h&value&EQ&P);subst args.
 destruct(InitCall.init_call_summary m b p value tau h P)as[mf[EV POST]];change(Post m mf b p tau h value)in POST;change(state_eval Execution.ge(Execution.entry(Args b p tau h value)m)=Some(Output tau h value,mf))in EV.
 assert(N:normal_state(Execution.entry(Args b p tau h value)m)=true)by(vm_compute;reflexivity).
 assert(CN:call_names(Execution.entry(Args b p tau h value)m))by(vm_compute;repeat constructor;simpl;intuition discriminate).
 eapply defined_evaluator_no_error;[exact N|exact CN|exact EV]. Qed.
Print Assumptions no_error_proved.
From FiveLowpassInitTermination Require Import Spec.
From FiveLowpassInit Require Import Source Execution.
From FiveLowpassSupport Require Import Straightline.
Theorem termination:Spec.AllSuccessorsTerminate.
Proof. unfold Spec.AllSuccessorsTerminate;intros args m;apply normal_all_successors_terminate;vm_compute;reflexivity. Qed.
Print Assumptions termination.
